This is a complete, self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Space Invaders arcade experience. It includes pixel-perfect sprites, authentic rules, and the original mechanics.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SPACE INVADERS · 1978 TAITO</title>
  <style>
    /* CRT scanline overlay + retro palette */
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      user-select: none;
    }
    body {
      background: #0a0a0a;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', 'Courier', monospace;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
    }
    .cabinet {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      border: 6px solid #2a2a3e;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 30px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 0 20px #3f3f5f;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .crt {
      background: #0f0f1a;
      border: 4px solid #3a3a4a;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 16px 8px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px #000, 0 0 0 2px #2e2e3e;
      position: relative;
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      background: #0a0a14;
      width: 600px;
      height: 600px;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #3f3f5f;
    }
    /* scanline overlay */
    .crt::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 0px,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 2px,
        transparent 2px,
        transparent 4px
      );
      pointer-events: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 16px;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .btn {
      background: #2a2a3a;
      border: 3px solid #4a4a5a;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: #ddd;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 8
